      "conversion": "targethandler (MixinSquared @Redirect of WetAir.check in Slice & Dice's LevelMixin.isRainingAt handler and of Level.getBlockState in its EntityMixin.baseTick handler) + a scan-state field on vanilla HashMapPalette reset at the head of read(FriendlyByteBuf). Since 1.0.49 the WetAir.check redirect answers on the client's main thread too (WetAirGateClient: ClientChunkCache.getChunk(x, z, FULL, false)) and, in the baseTick redirect on both sides, no read at all for an entity whose remainingFireTicks is 0 (clearFire would write the 0 it holds; classes overriding clearFire or setRemainingFireTicks keep the read). Sub-flags sliceanddiceWetAirGate.client, sliceanddiceWetAirGate.unlit.",
